## Compatibility decision

The frozen/slotted V4 `PanelAggregateSummary` and its exact-key reader live outside Task 5's source
scope. Adding a transition field there would be a backward-incompatible artifact-schema change.
Accordingly, aggregate readers remain unchanged. V4 audit simulations are explicitly transition-
aware and are transitively bound through the authenticated plan/provenance/bundle identities, while
the newly emitted parity panel/reference/attestation evidence carries the explicit optional
transition identity. This preserves old readers and changes future authenticated reruns only.

